{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write to you from the house of my friend van Ghert in Brussels. The evening is quiet, and I have taken a moment to rest my eyes after the journey. Madame van Ghert was kind enough to cut a quill pen for me this afternoon; it is sharp and cuts the paper well, which is all a man can ask for in these days. I also retrieved your letter from the post office earlier. Your words were a great comfort to me on the road.\n\nI think of you and the boys often. The air here is cool, and I find myself longing for the warmth of our home in Berlin. I hope your health is good and that Karl and Immanuel are diligent in their studies. I shall continue my journey soon, but for tonight, I am content to sit by the fire and write to you.\n\nYours always,\n\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080606,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":188,"prompt_tokens":915,"total_tokens":1103,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-lIXdYVxNb7hJpFXLbFBzKpJMU5XXqlpz","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":915,"prompt_ms":929.786,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.01615956284153,"prompt_per_second":984.0974159645338,"predicted_n":188,"predicted_ms":4503.228,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.081433155080216,"predicted_per_second":41.52576773816471}}